<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>CarHub Africa | Find Your Next Car</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      color: #111;
    }

    header {
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      padding: 18px 6%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #f5a623;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 520px;
      padding: 80px 6%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.68), rgba(0,0,0,.68)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492144534655-ae79c964c9d7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80")
        center/cover;
      color: white;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 650px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 76px);
      line-height: .95;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: #f5a623;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      color: #ddd;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #f5a623;
      color: #111;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }

    .btn.dark {
      background: white;
    }

    section {
      padding: 70px 6%;
    }

    .section-title {
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .section-title p {
      color: #666;
    }

    .cars {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .car-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 15px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    }

    .car-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 220px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .car-info {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .car-info h3 {
      font-size: 21px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .price {
      color: #f5a623;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .details {
      color: #777;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .small-btn {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .about {
      background: #111;
      color: white;
    }

    .about-content {
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .about h2 {
      font-size: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .about p {
      color: #ccc;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .contact {
      text-align: center;
      background: #f5a623;
    }

    .contact h2 {
      font-size: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .contact p {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    footer {
      background: #111;
      color: #aaa;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      nav {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 600px;
        padding: 60px 6%;
      }

      .cars {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 52px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 55px 6%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">CarHub <span>Africa</span></div>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#cars">Cars</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>Drive Your <span>Dream.</span></h1>

    <p>
      Discover quality cars across Africa.
      Browse our collection, find the right vehicle
      and connect with CarHub Africa.
    </p>

    <a href="#cars" class="btn">Explore Cars</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn dark">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="cars">

  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Featured Cars</h2>
    <p>Quality vehicles selected for African roads and lifestyles.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="cars">

    <div class="car-card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555215695-3004980ad54e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80">

      <div class="car-info">
        <h3>Luxury Sedan</h3>
        <div class="price">₦28,500,000</div>
        <div class="details">Automatic • Petrol • 2022</div>
        <a class="small-btn" href="#contact">Enquire Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="car-card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542362567-b07e54358753?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80">

      <div class="car-info">
        <h3>Premium Sports Car</h3>
        <div class="price">₦45,000,000</div>
        <div class="details">Automatic • Petrol • 2023</div>
        <a class="small-btn" href="#contact">Enquire Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="car-card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606664515524-ed2f786a0bd6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80">

      <div class="car-info">
        <h3>Modern SUV</h3>
        <div class="price">₦35,000,000</div>
        <div class="details">Automatic • Petrol • 2023</div>
        <a class="small-btn" href="#contact">Enquire Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-content">
    <h2>Built for Africa.</h2>

    <p>
      CarHub Africa connects car buyers with quality vehicles
      and makes discovering your next car simple, modern and reliable.
      From everyday vehicles to premium automobiles,
      we're building a better way to buy cars in Africa.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <h2>Ready for your next car?</h2>

  <p>
    Contact CarHub Africa and let's help you find the right vehicle.
  </p>

  <a class="btn dark" href="https://wa.me/2340000000000">
    WhatsApp Us
  </a>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 CarHub Africa. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
